		<link rel="alternate" href="http://forums.postgresql.fr/viewtopic.php?pid=23276#p23276"/>
		<content type="html"><![CDATA[<p>Est-ce que la requête suivante répond à votre problème ?</p><div class="codebox"><pre><code>WITH s AS (SELECT id, typid, lead(typid) OVER (w) AS lead_typid, datid, lead(datid) OVER (w) AS lead_datid
FROM tbl
WINDOW w AS (PARTITION BY id ORDER BY datid))
SELECT id, typid, count(*) + 1 FROM s where typid = lead_typid GROUP BY id, typid;</code></pre></div><p>Sur les données en exemple, cela me remonte :</p><div class="codebox"><pre><code> id │ typid │ ?column? 
════╪═══════╪══════════
  1 │     5 │        2
  1 │     8 │        3
  4 │     4 │        2</code></pre></div>]]></content>
